                                    'OK - Checked by C. Gnesutta on December 2nd, 2020.- EC-1Phase-50Hz/230V - Ziehl-Abegg- Ok
                                    ' C. Gnesutta, 7 Gennaio 2021
                                    thisCoilCapacity_EC_1Ph_Ziehl_Abegg_230V(idCM - 1, EC_Index) = (thisCoilCapacity_EC_1Ph_Ziehl_Abegg_230V(idCM - 1, EC_Index) * thisC3)

                                    '€€€€€€€€€€€€€€€€€€€€€€€€€€€€€€€€€€€€€€€€€€€€€€€€€€€€€€€€€€€€€€€€€€€€€€€€

