                            'Ok. May 20th 2013  - Ok, checked again by C. Gnesutta on April 16th, 2019.  - OK
                            'C. Gnesutta, 12 Ottobre 2021.
                            Case (4.8 <= TotalElectricalCurrent And TotalElectricalCurrent < 7.7)

                                'Corrected by C. Gnesutta on June 21st, 2021.
                                'C. Gnesutta, 12 Ottobre 2021.

